l na língua dela.\"\n— Bruxarias de Tumbagris", "mana_cost": "{3}{B}{B}", "name_en": "Sanguine Bond"}], "pt_print": {"id": "38cb83ba-96cf-4aad-ba39-2dc028c2ce03", "set": "wot", "number": "35", "hires": false}, "layout": "normal", "type_line": "Enchantment", "edhrec_rank": 507, "commander": true}, "print": {"id": "ad4de9f1-7a39-45af-828e-c59234d9e9b9", "oracle_id": "73089a39-a2f6-4aa2-a058-e6551475153d", "set_code": "c21", "set_name": "Commander 2021", "number": "153", "released": "2021-04-23", "artist": "Jaime Jones", "frame": "2015", "effects": null, "border": "black", "layout": "normal", "highres": true, "promo": false, "mana_cost": "{3}{B}{B}", "has_pt": false, "two_sided": false, "supported": true}}, {"card": {"oracle_id": "7735eeba-693b-47e2-bd51-414379cf1016", "name_en": "Beast Within", "name_pt": "Fera Interior", "search_en": "beast within", "search_pt": "fera interior", "source": "arena", "text_print": {"set": "mar", "number": "75"}, "faces": [{"name_pt": "Fera Interior", "type_pt": "Mágica Instantânea", "text_pt": "Destrua a permanente alvo. Seu controlador cria uma ficha de criatura Besta verde 3/3.", "flavor_pt": null, "mana_cost": "{2}{G}", "name_en": "Beast Within"}], "pt_print": {"id": "cdb2b1d4-43f6-4708-8f7d-5071192eb527", "set": "lcc", "number": "233", "hires": false}, "layout": "normal", "type_line": "Instant", "edhrec_rank": 25, "commander": true}, "print": {"id": "1929cf4b-0d18-4f7d-a631-621a378ff015", "oracle_id": "7735eeba-693b-47e2-bd51-414379cf1016", "set_code": "trc", "set_name": "Star Trek Commander", "number": "459", "released": "2026-11-13", "artist": "Filipe Pagliuso", "frame": "2015", "effects": null, "border": "black", "layout": "normal", "highres": true, "promo": false, "mana_cost": "{2}{G}", "has_pt": false, "two_sided": false, "supported": true}}, {"card": {"oracle_id": "8b755881-a72d-4e21-a369-d2924eb4585a", "name_en": "Cultivate", "name_pt": "Cultivar", "search_en": "cultivate", "search_pt": "cultivar", "source": "arena", "text_print": {"set": "fic", "number": "300"}, "faces": [{"name_pt": "Cultivar", "type_pt": "Feitiço", "text_pt": "Procure em seu grimório até dois cards de terreno básico, revele-os, coloque um deles no campo de batalha virado e o outro na sua mão e, depois, embaralhe.", "flavor_pt": "\"Dizem que não cresce grama nem flores em Midgar. Mas, por alguma razão, as flores crescem sem problemas aqui.\"", "mana_cost": "{2}{G}", "name_en": "Cultivate"}], "pt_print": {"id": "53e58830-4674-4d1d-8731-dd34c93f5cfb", "set": "lcc", "number": "235", "hires": false}, "layout": "normal", "type_line": "Sorcery", "edhrec_rank": 20, "commander": true}, "print": {"id": "a78f5d3f-74d6-4ec1-89c4-e24639d3f4ba", "oracle_id": "8b755881-a72d-4e21-a369-d2924eb4585a", "set_code": "trc", "set_name": "Star Trek Commander", "number": "460", "released": "2026-11-13", "artist": "Ariel Orea", "frame": "2015", "effects": null, "border": "black", "layout": "normal", "highres": true, "promo": false, "mana_cost": "{2}{G}", "has_pt": false, "two_sided": false, "supported": true}}, {"card": {"oracle_id": "9ad730b5-8950-4215-9319-387e2970dd22", "name_en": "Exemplar of Light", "name_pt": "Exemplar da Luz", "search_en": "exemplar of light", "search_pt": "exemplar da luz", "source": "arena", "text_print": {"set": "fdn", "number": "297"}, "faces": [{"name_pt": "Exemplar da Luz", "type_pt": "Criatura — Anjo", "text_pt": "Voar\nToda vez que você ganhar pontos de vida, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nesta criatura.\nToda vez que você colocar um ou mais marcadores +1/+1 nesta criatura, compre um card. Esta habilidade é desencadeada apenas uma vez a cada turno.", "flavor_pt": null, "mana_cost": "{2}{W}{W}", "name_en": "Exemplar of Light"}], "pt_print": null, "layout": "normal", "type_line": "Creature — Angel", "edhrec_rank": 1089, "commander": true}, "print": {"id": "4331836b-fa3c-4505-9361-a0b82aef63f5", "oracle_id": "9ad730b5-8950-4215-9319-387e2970dd22", "set_code": "fdc", "set_name": "Foundations Commander", "number": "28",